     "text": "The scholars of the ummah have added to exegetical literature in every age. Exegeses of the Quran al-Hakim have kept being made in different manners and from different angles of view, and this series will continue till the Day of Judgement. The scholars have also made different categories of exegeses, among which narration-based exegesis, juristic exegesis, literary exegesis, theological exegesis, historical exegesis, and traditional and modernist exegeses are more famous.",
