     "text": "Allah Most High has emphasised that the real believers are those who spend the best things in His way. Whatever wealth man earns, he earns it in reality only on the strength of the abilities and powers given by Allah Most High. In the same way whatever the earth produces, that happens merely by virtue of the perfect power of Allah Most High, because without His will and intent not even a leaf can move. Therefore the believers are being urged that, before spending in the way of God, they should see well that the wealth must be excellent. Such wealth or things which, while taking, you yourselves would not like, avoid spending them too in the way of Allah.",
