   "theory": "Exercise\n\nQuestion 1: Write the answers of the following questions in detail.\n\n1. Write a note on the importance of zakat in the Islamic society.\n\n2. \"Spending in the way of Allah\" holds a central place among Islamic acts of worship. Discuss.\n\n3. Discuss the duties of the individual in common life.\n\n4. What are the important duties of the Islamic state?\n\n5. What are the basic rules of spending in the way of Allah?\n\nQuestion 2: Give short answers to the following questions.\n\n1. What is meant by enjoining good and forbidding evil?\n\n2. What are the heads of expenditure of zakat?\n\n3. Who are the rightful recipients of voluntary charities (sadaqat-e-nafila)?\n\n4. Explain «لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون».\n\n5. What is meant by economic equality?\n\n6. How has Islam encouraged earning a livelihood?\n\n7. What is meant by sovereignty (iqtidar-e-a'la)?\n\n8. Throw light on the justice system of Islam.\n\n9. How should we treat non-Muslims?",
