     "text": "Spending in the way of Allah is mentioned at many places in the Wise Quran. Spending in the way of Allah is in fact also trusting in Allah. Those who spend with this feeling, Allah the Exalted favours them even more. It is the mistaken notion of man that he thinks he has earned by his own strength, and he forgets that the giver of health and strength too is Allah the Exalted. Therefore we should spend as much as possible on the servants of Allah in the way of Allah.",
