     "text": "Allah the Exalted says that both forms of spending are good. By it Allah the Exalted forgives sins. He promises forgiveness and creates such circumstances that He keeps those who give charity away from sins. Allah the Exalted knows even the secrets of hearts. He sees intentions. He is aware of every deed. We should keep our intention right in both forms so that we become deserving of reward and recompense.",
