     "text": "In the Islamic economic system there is absolutely no room for interest-based business. Islam encourages trade and qard-e-hasanah (benevolent loans). There is blessing in trade. However, methods and principles of trade too have been stated so that evils like unlawful profiteering and adulteration do not arise. Since interest becomes the cause of the promotion of the concentration of wealth and pushes the poor further into poverty, therefore it has been discouraged. People involved in interest-based business should repent of it immediately, otherwise their acts of worship will be of no use to them, because this is open war with Allah and His Messenger.",
