     "text": "… and Owner. He has been from eternity and will remain till eternity. He is One, without partner. He has power over everything and is the Master of the Day of the Hereafter. Believers also believe in the angels of Allah, that they are the creation of Allah. At all times they remain busy in worship and are free from sins. They also have certainty in all the heavenly Books, and also believe in those scriptures which Allah the Exalted sent down upon various prophets for the guidance of human beings. Believers also believe in all the prophets and do not differentiate between any of them. However, some prophets have superiority over others, just as our Master and Lord Hazrat Muhammad Mustafa ﷺ is the leader of all prophets and messengers.",
