   "content": "<p>Exercise</p><p>Question 1: Write short answers to the following questions.</p><p>i. State the definition of Hadith.</p><p>ii. How did Allah the Exalted bestow a favour on the believers?</p><p>iii. How is obedience to the Noble Prophet ﷺ obedience to Allah?</p><p>iv. What misunderstanding did the orientalists create in the matter of Hadith?</p><p>v. What are the kinds of ahadith with respect to isnad?</p><p>vi. Write the definitions of Sahabi and Tabi&#x27;i.</p><p>vii. With respect to the number of narrators, how many kinds of Hadith are there?</p><p>viii. What is meant by the science of Asma&#x27; al-Rijal?</p><p>ix. State the introduction of Sahih Bukhari.</p><p>x. Acting on which principles did Imam Bukhari (may Allah have mercy on him) and Imam Muslim (may Allah have mercy on him) write their books?</p><p>Question 2: Write the answers to the following questions in detail.</p><p>i. Comment on Hadith as a source of injunctions.</p><p>ii. State the legislative status of Hadith.</p><p>iii. What do you know about the authority of Hadith?</p><p>iv. Which sciences came into existence for the knowledge of Hadith?</p><p>v. State the kinds of Hadith with respect to the probity of the narrator.</p>",
