     "text": "Translation: It is narrated from Hazrat Abu Hurayrah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Noble Prophet ﷺ said: the person who strives in helping the widow and the needy is like that mujahid who strives in the way of Allah, or like that person who stands in prayer at night and fasts by day.",
