     "text": "Muslims not only expanded their territory by making conquests and lit the lamp of the religion of Islam, but also did such works in knowledge and wisdom whose example is not found in the world; and if it is said that Muslims laid the foundation of religious and worldly sciences in the correct sense, it would not be out of place. In history the era of the rule of Muslims in Andalus is called the golden era of the progress of the knowledge and wisdom of Muslims.",
