   "content": "<p>4. Responsibilities of the Muslim Ummah with reference to academic progress in the present age and the future</p><p>Man was granted the wealth of knowledge, which is mentioned in Surah al-Baqarah. From this the connection of knowledge with Muslims becomes known, that Muslims received knowledge as a great gift of Allah the Exalted. Likewise, when the very first revelation was sent down upon the Noble Prophet ﷺ, that too was with reference to knowledge, which were the first five verses of Surah al-&#x27;Alaq.</p><p>اِقْرَاْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ الَّذِيْ خَلَقَ ۞ خَلَقَ الْاِنْسَانَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ ۞ اِقْرَاْ وَرَبُّكَ الْاَكْرَمُ ۞ الَّذِيْ عَلَّمَ بِالْقَلَمِ ۞ عَلَّمَ الْاِنْسَانَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ (العلق: 5-1)</p><p>Translation: O Prophet! Read with the name of your Lord who created the entire universe; who created man from a clot of blood. Read, and your Lord is most Generous; who taught knowledge by means of the pen, and taught man those things which he did not know.</p><p>Acquiring knowledge has been made obligatory on Muslims. By acting upon this, Muslims ruled not only Arabia but almost the whole world. History bears witness that the secret of the success of Muslims was in acting upon the teachings of Allah the Exalted and passing through stages of progress in knowledge. Muslims in a very short period established their empire from Arabia to non-Arab lands, and accomplished invaluable services in the field of knowledge and wisdom, which we have mentioned earlier. But unfortunately the coming generations of Muslims showed shortcomings in looking after the academic treasure of their forefathers, and non-Muslims adopted it, and that is why today Muslims have been left behind them. Those people, passing through stages of progress, have become a Super Power. Because of the neglect and incompetence of Muslims they have made the treasure of Muslims their inheritance.</p><p>With reference to academic progress in the present age and the future, some responsibilities fall upon Muslims, by fulfilling which Muslims can again rule the world. Some of these responsibilities are as follows.</p>",
