     "text": "In the Islamic state a balanced system of collective justice prevails. It is an all-encompassing state and remains encompassing the whole of human life. In the Islamic state there is neither the compulsion of dictatorship, nor is personal freedom taken away. The Islamic state is a welfare state and remains engaged wholeheartedly in the welfare and well-being of its inhabitants. In the Islamic state non-Muslims too have protection. The protection of their life, property and honour is the responsibility of the state. In the Islamic state the organs of the state are mutually linked. The centre and axis of all institutions is one point: that the sovereignty of Allah be established on the earth, there be no injustice and excess upon anyone, and peace and tranquillity prevail socially.",
