   "content": "<p>Training of consciousness</p><p>For any nation the most dangerous thing is that it be empty of correct consciousness. About Muslim countries, if it is said that the civic, cultural and political consciousness of their public is extremely weak, it will not be out of place. It has to be said with regret that their dealing with well-wisher and ill-wisher is almost the same. Their memory is extremely weak. They immediately forget the past of their leaders and guides and the events of the recent past. Their political consciousness is almost non-existent; this is the reason that they have become the plaything of dominant nations and selfish leaders. Governments keep making decisions against their will. The great service of Muslims will be this, that correct consciousness be created in their various classes, and intellectual, civic and political training of the masses be done.</p><p>Freedom from selfishness and self-worship</p><p>Selfishness and egoism, whether personal or family, communal or class-based, are an unnatural thing for the life of nations, from which freedom must be obtained at the first opportunity. The future of the world is now linked only with a justice-loving, merciful and balanced Islam. In Islam there is no room for this kind of egoism and selfishness. In it there is no place for planting the foot of personal superiority or family superiority and selfishness, which today is found in some Eastern nations and Islamic countries.</p><p>Industrial and military preparation</p><p>If Muslims have the desire for an Islamic state and the spread of the message of Islam is their purpose, then for it they will need distinguished strength and training, industry and sciences, commerce, and complete preparation in the art of war. They will have to become independent of and free from need of the West in every field of life and in every need of theirs. As long as Muslims remain dependent on the West in knowledge, politics, industry and commerce, the West will keep sucking their blood. It is the result of this negligence in the academic and industrial branch that the West is dominant over the world, and has involved Muslims in destruction, plunder, killing and bloodshed and suicide.</p><p>New academic organisation</p><p>If it is the desire of Muslims that they begin their life afresh and are free from the slavery of others, then …</p>",
