   "theory": "f. The status of man on the earth is that of Allah's ______.\n\ng. The religion of Islam has fixed the ______ of the employer and the employee.\n\nQuestion 3: Put ✓ in front of correct sentences and ✗ in front of wrong ones.\n\ni. The Muslim ruler is autonomous.\n\nii. Islam has established the prohibition of interest and gambling.\n\niii. The Islamic state is all-encompassing.\n\niv. The protection of life, property and honour is not the responsibility of the state.\n\nv. The academic backwardness of Muslims too is an obstacle in the establishment of the Islamic state.\n\nvi. Islam protects the rights of Muslims only.\n\nvii. In the eighteenth century CE Muslims had obtained freedom.\n\nviii. In the First Great War Muslims achieved victory.\n\nix. Islamic states are established in all Muslim countries.\n\nx. In the present era all Muslim countries are linked in mutual unity.\n\nActivities\n\ni. Write the names of twenty Islamic countries.\n\nii. Write the names of such Islamic countries where the market of terrorism from the side of disbelievers is hot.\n\niii. Discuss the role of youth in the Islamic state.\n\niv. Write the names of a few big Islamic movements.",
